      "id": "legend",
      "x": 366,
      "y": -1096,
      "width": 396.00000000000006,
      "height": 240,
      "text": "Seasonal booking payments: ticket split\n\n- An arrow from A to B: A blocks B.\n- Arrows always point down.\n- Links that other links imply are not drawn.\n- Blue: backend.\n- Green: frontend.\n- Pink: design and text (UX).\n- Yellow: operations.\n- Cyan: end-to-end tests.\n- Grey, dashed: verkkokauppa work.\n- Thick purple border: has an open PR.",
      "originalText": "Seasonal booking payments: ticket split\n\n- An arrow from A to B: A blocks B.\n- Arrows always point down.\n- Links that other links imply are not drawn.\n- Blue: backend.\n- Green: frontend.\n- Pink: design and text (UX).\n- Yellow: operations.\n- Cyan: end-to-end tests.\n- Grey, dashed: verkkokauppa work.\n- Thick purple border: has an open PR.",
      "containerId": null,
      "index": "a0000001001001001001001001001001001001001001001",
      "seed": 761584075,
      "version": 33,
      "created": 1795170604393,
